# Anchored to the repo root only (unanchored basenames would also ignore
# infra/README.md, infra/AGENTS.md, infra/ergo/AGENTS.md - added 2026-09-01,
# those MUST stow-link into ~/infra). The optional leading slash covers both
# matchers: GNU stow matches slash-containing patterns against "/<rel>",
# stow-drift matches plain "<rel>". Side effect of anchoring: .pi/agent/README.md
# now links too (harmless doc; the other .pi READMEs sit under folded dir links).
^/?README\.md$
^/?AGENTS\.md$
